                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This repository contains all data and code necessary to reproduce the experiments and figures in the article: \"Enhancing optical flow-based control by learning visual appearance cues for flying robots\". It allows to reproduce both the experiments in simulation and the real-world experiments with the Parrot Bebop 2 drone. Please see the README in the repository for a detailed explanation.\r\n\r\nPlease note that the Paparazzi code included in this data set is subject to a GNU left license. See https://github.com/paparazzi/paparazzi/blob/master/LICENSE for more details."
